              "id": "5197b595-99c4-53e8-920c-d86e4320a62f",
              "name": "message",
              "type": "string",
              "value": "Hey {{first_name}}, this is {{rep_first_name}} from PlayYourCourt. I saw you started to sign up for our tennis membership, but didn't finish. Here's a link {{checkout_url}} to pick up where you left off. {{first_name}}, did you have any questions or problems getting signed up? Reply STOP to opt out."
